Add these fields under vessel object, in registration update API Request/Payload:

	 String surveyId;

	 BigDecimal lengthOfVessel = BigDecimal.ZERO;

	 BigDecimal breadthOfVessel = BigDecimal.ZERO;

	 BigDecimal depthOfVessel = BigDecimal.ZERO;

	 String hullMaterial;

	 BigDecimal noOfBulkheads;
	
	
Add these fields under engine object, in registration update API Request/Payload:
	
	 String boilderDescription;
	 
	 String boilerNumber;
	 
	 String loadedPressure;
	 
	 BigDecimal lengthOfEngineRoom
	 
	Integer noOfCylinderPerSetRotaryEngine;
	
	Integer noOfCylinderPerSetReciprocatingEngine = 0;
	
	Integer noOfShaft = 0;
